//- COLD OPEN (0:00, 2:00). Lemon starts the real intro and a fake Slack message cuts him off about 8 seconds in. Acted out.
section

  section.hello(data-timing="10")
    h1 Hi!
    h2 My name is Lemon.
    aside.notes
      ul
        li ⏱ 0:00. Reset the speaker timer here. Start the intro for real.
        li About 8 seconds in, the Slack message lands.

  +gag("A fake Slack notification slides in over the intro: \"See? We're basically done.\" with a 🎉 reaction. Built in the deck, acted out.")(data-timing="40")
    h2 See? We're basically done. 🎉
    aside.notes
      ul
        li React to it. Read it out.
        li Somebody in that channel just aged five years.

  section.statement(data-timing="40")
    h2 Nobody misread the findings.
    p.fragment They misread how final they were.
    aside.notes
      ul
        li The abstract's line, said straight.

  section.statement(data-timing="30")
    h2 Anyway.
    aside.notes
      ul
        li Back to the intro, from the top.
